  <p>Reservation ads add their own rules on the same page: no watermarks, including TikTok's own, nothing that mimics the TikTok interface, and no white or transparent backgrounds, because the app's names, captions and icons are white. Captions show four lines before "See more." TikTok suggests staying within 100 characters, or 50 in Chinese, Japanese or Korean.</p>

